OL,3,AElon Musk's millions fail to deliver
OL,4,ATexas for the Republicans in fierce
OL,5,Amidterms
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocrat James Talarico's resounding
OL,8,Fvictory in the Texas Senate race caused
OL,9,Fa major upset in the midterms for
OL,10,FRepublicans - and for Elon Musk.
OL,12,FAccording to the Financial Times, the
OL,13,Fbillionaire's political action
OL,14,Fcommittee (Pac) contributed $47m (#35m)
OL,15,Fto Republican candidate Ken Paxton's
OL,16,Fcampaign, on top of the $158m he gave
OL,17,Fthe Senate Leadership Fund in
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
