OL,3,ARussian hacktivists say they were
OL,4,Abehind freezer hacks, but speculation
OL,5,Aremains
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Russian hacktivist groups have
OL,8,Fclaimed they worked together on the
OL,9,Fwaves of freezer hacks which have
OL,10,Faffected European supermarkets.
OL,12,FNoname057(16) and Z-Pentest Alliance
OL,13,Fposted on Telegram that they were
OL,14,Fresponsible, bragging that they had
OL,15,F"once again demonstrated a high level
OL,16,Fof skill and precision".
OL,18,FBut their posts and channels have now
OL,19,Fbeen deleted and their claims are being
OL,20,Fmet with some scepticism.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
