OL,3,AGraduates are managing AI - but are
OL,4,Athey learning much else?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent university graduate Lotte
OL,7,FUnderwood is a public relations
OL,8,Fexecutive with a twist - she spends
OL,9,Fmore time using AI than actually doing
OL,10,FPR.
OL,12,FUnderwood, 25, joined London-based PR
OL,13,Fagency Fight or Flight in November last
OL,14,Fyear, in the new role of "AI associate"
OL,15,Fafter completing a degree and then a
OL,16,Fmasters in marketing.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793807649
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AGraduates are managing AI - but are
OL,4,Athey learning much else?
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe's part of a recently established,
OL,7,Fdedicated AI team that has built around
OL,8,F30 AI agents. Specific tasks include
OL,9,Findustry research, client reporting,
OL,10,Fmedia interview preparation, helping
OL,11,Fclients create clearer briefs, and
OL,12,Fimage generation.
OL,14,FA big part of Underwood's job is to
OL,15,Fmanage those agents, check their
OL,16,Foutputs and feed those to the team
OL,17,Fmembers who are dealing directly with
OL,18,Fclients and the media.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
